        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 26 at 8:33AM CDT by NWS Green Bay WI</headline>
        <description>Locally dense fog continues to restrict visibilities to a quarter
mile or less across parts of northeast Wisconsin. The dense fog is
most widespread from Shawano and Pulaski to Crivitz and Wausaukee.
were visibilities are a quarter mile or less as of 8 AM.

If you plan to travel this morning, be alert for rapidly changing
visibilities. If you encounter dense fog, slow down and use your
low beam headlights.
</description>
